# Paper sources, kept on disk for reference but never committed: two arXiv
# tarballs plus their extracted figure trees are 35MB of binaries that would
# live in history forever.
papers/

# results/ holds two very different things. The raw PSBD stage-1 tensors are
# large, regenerable, and stay out. psbd_metrics.json is the small derived
# detection record (TPR/FPR/AUROC per placement and rate), and every number
# reported anywhere has to trace back to a commit, so it is versioned.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# directories are deliberately left un-ignored (line 2) purely so the negation
# on line 3 can be reached. Only the metrics files come back.
results/**
!results/**/
!results/**/psbd_metrics.json
